    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        ML-Master: Towards AI-for-AI via Integration of Exploration and Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+Z">Zexi Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Cai%2C+Y">Yuzhu Cai</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhu%2C+X">Xinyu Zhu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zheng%2C+Y">Yujie Zheng</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Chen%2C+R">Runkun Chen</a>, 
      
