      <p class="list-title is-inline-block"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.13068">arXiv:2506.13068</a>
        <span>&nbsp;[<a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2506.13068">pdf</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/ps/2506.13068">ps</a>, <a href="https://arxiv.org/format/2506.13068">other</a>]&nbsp;</span>
